","locid":"929fc31a-f5b6-45b8-b3ed-29bd2c4b4bf7","name":"Jensen, Martin Bach","name_org":"Jensen, Martin B","orcid":"0000-0003-2162-7390","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"8","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne","key":"würtzenpau","last":"Würtzen","name":"Würtzen, Hanne","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"9 10","corresponding":null,"first":"Patricia A","key":"poulinpau","last":"Poulin","name":"Poulin, Patricia A","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"11 12","corresponding":null,"first":"Gitte","key":"handbergpau","last":"Handberg","locid":"34fd6956-be73-41c2-b230-02961b03c9ec","name":"Handberg, Gitte","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"13","corresponding":null,"first":"Connie","key":"zieglerpau","last":"Ziegler","name":"Ziegler, Connie","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"13","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars B","key":"moellerpau","last":"Moeller","name":"Moeller, Lars B","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"14","corresponding":null,"first":"Judi","key":"olsenpau","last":"Olsen","name":"Olsen, Judi","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"13","corresponding":null,"first":"Lotte","key":"heisepau","last":"Heise","name":"Heise, Lotte","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Michael S","key":"rathleffpau","last":"Rathleff","locid":"90c1260f-4cd4-497f-88ca-a98f412bbe7b","name":"Rathleff, Michael Skovdal","name_org":"Rathleff, Michael S","orcid":"0000-0003-1173-0335","rank":23,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36602421"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1097/j.pain.0000000000002855","issn":["03043959","18726623"],"issn_org":["03043959"],"issue":"7","journal":"Pain","pages":"1406-1415","publisher":"Lippincott Williams and Wilkins","status":"p","title":"Pain","volume":"164"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85163474371"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Private Research","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","North Denmark Region","Other Companies","Other Hospitals","Other Research","Private Research","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark","fibromyalgi- & smerteforeningen","nordic institute of health economics a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-6f090aa8-cf30-4e97-97e9-d5a6abd7b021","sdu-006cb5ac-d40d-406a-b73c-80c71e4bc18c"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"What is known and what is still unknown within chronic musculoskeletal pain? : A systematic evidence and gap map","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.50-672349","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Objectives Patient and stakeholder engagements in research have increasingly gained attention in healthcare and healthcare-related research. A common and rigorous approach to establish research priorities based on input from people and stakeholders is the James Lind Alliance Priority Setting Partnership (JLA-PSP). The aim of this study was to establish research priorities for chronic musculoskeletal (MSK) pain by engaging with people living with chronic MSK pain, relatives to people living with chronic MSK pain, healthcare professionals (HCP), and researchers working with chronic MSK pain. Methods This JLA-PSP included a nation-wide survey in Denmark, an interim prioritisation, and an online consensus building workshop. The information gained from this was the basis for developing the final list of specific research priorities within chronic MSK pain. Results In the initial survey, 1010 respondents (91% people living with chronic MSK pain/relatives, 9% HCPs/researchers) submitted 3121 potential questions. These were summarised into 19 main themes and 36 sub-themes. In the interim prioritisation exercise, 51% people living with pain/relatives and 49% HCPs/researchers reduced the list to 33 research questions prior to the final priority setting workshop. 23 participants attended the online workshop (12 people/relatives, 10 HCPs, and 1 researcher) who reached consensus for the most important research priorities after two rounds of discussion of each question. Conclusions This study identified several specific research questions generated by people living with chronic MSK pain, relatives, HCPs, and researchers. The stakeholders proposed prioritization of the healthcare system’s ability to support patients, focus on developing coherent pathways between sectors and education for both patients and HCP. These research questions can form the basis for future studies, funders, and be used to align research with end-users’ priorities.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Lyng, Kristian Damgaard","Larsen, Jesper Bie","Birnie, Kathryn A.","Stinson, Jennifer","Hoegh, Morten","Palsson, Thorvaldur Skuli","Olesen, Anne Estrup","Arendt-Nielsen, Lars","Ehlers, Lars Holger","Fonager, Kirsten","Jensen, Martin Bach","Würtzen, Hanne","Poulin, Patricia A.","Handberg, Gitte","Ziegler, Connie","Møller, Lars B.","Olsen, Judi","Heise, Lotte","Rathleff, Michael Skovdal"],"cuid":["S02-099.95-665900"],"filters":{"added":"2022-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Rathleff, Michael S","Rathleff, Michael Skovdal"],"country":["Canada"],"glorg":["Alberta Children's Hospital","Alberta Children's Hospital Research Institute","All Global Affiliations","Hospital for Sick Children","Ottawa Hospital","Ottawa Hospital Research Institute","The Hospital for Sick Children","University of Calgary","University of Ottawa","University of Toronto"],"keyword":["Chronic musculoskeletal pain","Patient and public involvement","Research priorities"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR"],"OT":["Gigtforeningen"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"participatory research a priority setting partnership for chronic musculoskeletal pain in denmark","src":["aau","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/213416715/10.1515_sjpain_2022_0019.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-099.95-665900","identifier":[{"id":"35918804","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85135454424","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-9afb4c