{"author_count":3,"contributors":["Fink-Jensen, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-452476"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Danmark","Det Humanistiske Fakultet","Skole"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kristendom skole og pædagogik i danmark før 000000001700","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-452476","ids":["ku-62b89ab5-63ca-4b24-9cb0-1c48e7abcf22"],"keyword":["Danmark","Det Humanistiske Fakultet","Skole"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6544BCEA161E68592E22A04F755B4FE7"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, SAXO-Institute - Archaeology, Ethnology, Greek & Latin, History"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Morten","key":"finkjensenpau","last":"Fink-Jensen","locid":"86d5c9ea-3371-44fd-8416-36ca65053424","name":"Fink-Jensen, Morten","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Niels Henrik","key":"gregersenpedh","last":"Gregersen","name":"Gregersen, Niels Henrik","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Carsten","key":"bachnielsenpedh","last":"Bach-Nielsen","name":"Bach-Nielsen, Carsten","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788776749613"],"pages":"369-389","place":"Odense","publisher":"Syddansk Universitetsforlag","status":"p","title":"Reformationen i dansk kirke og kultur 1517-2017, bind 1-3","volume":"1"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-62b89ab5-63ca-4b24-9cb0-1c48e7abcf22"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Kristendom, skole og pædagogik i Danmark før 1700","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-452476","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"The pathogenesis of colorectal neoplasia (CRN) has been associated with altered non-neuronal acetylcholine (ACh) metabolism. The aim of this study was to characterize expression, function, and cellular location of ACh-related proteins in biopsies obtained from endoscopic normal-appearing sigmoid colon in patients with and without CRN. Messenger-RNA (mRNA) levels of 17 ACh-related proteins were quantified by rt-qPCR. Functional responses to ACh, measured as electrogenic transepithelial short circuit current (SCC), were recorded using the Ussing chamber technique. Finally, cellular localization of choline transporter-like proteins (CTLs) and butyryl-cholinesterase enzyme (BChE) was determined by immunohistochemistry. mRNA expression of CTL1 and CTL4 was increased in patients with CRN (P = 0.002 and P = 0.04, respectively). In functional experiments, baseline SCC was increased in CRN patients. ACh induced rapid biphasic changes in SCC. An initial decreasing phase was observed in the minority of CRN patients versus the majority of controls (25% vs 69%, respectively, P = 0.031). For the second increasing phase of SCC, data indicated ACh-activation of two receptors. For both parts of the biphasic response, the half maximal effective concentration and maximal responses showed no difference between patient groups. Immunohistochemistry demonstrated CTL1, 3 and 4 and BChE to be localized to colonic crypt cells. We conclude that CRN is associated with increased expression of CTL1 and CTL4, augmented basal prostaglandin-dependent secretion, and altered functional channel response to ACh in human endoscopic normal-appearing colonic mucosa. The immunohistochemical findings support CTL1, CTL3, CTL4, and BChE to be involved in non-neuronal mucosal ACh metabolism.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Damm, Morten Matthiesen Bach","Jensen, Thorbjørn Søren Rønn","Mahmood, Badar","Lundh, Morten","Poulsen, Steen Seier","Bindslev, Niels","Hansen, Mark Berner"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-499609"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"acetylcholine related proteins in non neoplastic appearing colonic mucosa from patients with colorectal neoplasia","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/283138580/Acetylcholine_related_proteins_in_non_neoplastic_appearing.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-499609","identifier":[{"id":"85021286915","type":"scopus"},{"id":"28544328","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-b1ca1915-d79c-4fb2-b424-6ef24797a0ee"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4D52E81ADC3FDD04BC4E05EC5EC576BA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/283138580/Acetylcholine_related_proteins_in_non_neoplastic_appearing.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Novo Nordisk Foundation Center for Basic Metabolic Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Morten Matthiesen Bach","key":"dammpau","last":"Damm","name":"Damm, Morten Matthiesen Bach","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Thorbjørn Søren Rønn","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Thorbjørn Søren Rønn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Badar","key":"mahmoodpau","last":"Mahmood","name":"Mahmood, Badar","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Morten","key":"lundhpau","last":"Lundh","locid":"68d27e9f-656d-4e57-9090-56f9e9373fc1","name":"Lundh, Morten","orcid":"0000-0003-0918-577X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Steen Seier","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","locid":"8959d81d-fe64-4ef4-86b7-003b7b637e8e","name":"Poulsen, Steen Seier","orcid":"0000-0003-4419-4911","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Niels","key":"bindslevpau","last":"Bindslev","locid":"b34ae3f8-b3e3-4f9f-9b46-3c63a950cb4f","name":"Bindslev, Niels","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Mark Berner","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Mark Berner","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28544328"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/mc.22675","issn":["08991987","10982744"],"issn_org":["08991987"],"issue":"10","journal":"Molecular Carcinogenesis","pages":"2223-2233","status":"p","title":"Molecular Carcinogenesis","volume":"56"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85021286915"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-b1ca1915-d79c-4fb2-b424-6ef24797a0ee"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Acetylcholine-related proteins in non-neoplastic appearing colonic mucosa from patients with colorectal neoplasia","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-499609","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"author_count":3,"contributors":["Kaalund, Søren","Skjoldager, Morten","Jensen, Martin Bach"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-081345"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"team i teamet opsættet i en professionel fodboldklub","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.dansksportsmedicin.dk/pdf/201603.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-081345","ids":["aau-6ba151ce-7469-4ea8-a040-272ea36eb5b5"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-72F0E6EF8E79075CF1C507BB0DD5E80C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.dansksportsmedicin.dk/pdf/201603.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine, Center for General Practice at Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"kaalundpau","last":"Kaalund","name":"Kaalund, Søren","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"skjoldagerpau","last":"Skjoldager","name":"Skjoldager, Morten","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martin Bach","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"929fc31a-f5b6-45b8-b3ed-29bd2c4b4bf7","name":"Jensen, Martin Bach","orcid":"0000-0003-2162-7390","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["13974211"],"issue":"3","journal":"Dansk Sportsmedicin","pages":"34-35","status":"p","title":"Dansk Sportsmedicin","volume":"20"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-6ba151ce-7469-4ea8-a040-272ea36eb5b5"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Team i TEAMET : Opsættet i en professionel fodboldklub","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-081345","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Intracellular signaling through cyclic nucleotides, both cyclic AMP and cyclic GMP, is altered in colorectal cancer. Accordingly, it is hypothesized that an underlying mechanism for colorectal neoplasia involves altered function of phosphodiesterases (PDEs), which affects cyclic nucleotide degradation. Here we present an approach to evaluate the function of selected cyclic nucleotide-PDEs in colonic endoscopic biopsies from non-neoplastic appearing mucosa. METHODS: Biopsies were obtained from patients with and without colorectal neoplasia. Activities of PDEs were characterized functionally by measurements of transepithelial ion transport and their expression and localization by employing real-time qPCR and immunohistochemistry. RESULTS: In functional studies PDE subtype-4 displayed lower activity in colorectal neoplasia patients (p = 0.006). Furthermore, real-time qPCR analysis showed overexpression of subtype PDE4B (p = 0.002) and subtype PDE5A (p = 0.02) in colorectal neoplasia patients. Finally, immunohistochemistry for 7 PDE isozymes demonstrated the presence of all 7 isozymes, albeit with weak reactions, and with no differences in localization between colorectal neoplasia and control patients. Of note, quantification of PDE subtype immunostaining revealed a lower amount of PDE3A (p = 0.04) and a higher amount of PDE4B (p = 0.02) in samples from colorectal neoplasia patients. CONCLUSION: In conclusion, functional data indicated lower activity of PDE4 subtypes while expressional and abundance data indicated a higher expression of PDE4B in patients with colorectal neoplasia. We suggest that cyclic nucleotide-PDE4B is overexpressed as a malfunctioning protein in non-neoplastic appearing colonic mucosa from patients with colorectal neoplasia. If a predisposition of reduced PDE4B activity in colonic mucosa from colorectal neoplasia patients is substantiated further, this subtype could be a potential novel early diagnostic risk marker and may even be a target for future medical preventive treatment of colorectal cancer.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Mahmood, Badar","Damm, Morten Matthiesen Bach","Jensen, Thorbjørn Søren Rønn","Backe, Marie Balslev","Dahllöf, Mattias Salling","Poulsen, Steen Seier","Bindslev, Niels","Hansen, Mark Berner"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-479428"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"phosphodiesterases in non neoplastic appearing colonic mucosa from patients with colorectal neoplasia","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12885-016-2980-z","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-479428","identifier":[{"id":"PMC5141637","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"27927168","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85002378031","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-8fe0057a-8548-4afe-a829-2ccb4e891d76"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-ED2E7772A89022EC7FAB6E96A5EFB065"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/176889490/art_3A10.1186_2Fs12885_016_2980_z.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12885-016-2980-z","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Endocrinology and Metabolism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Badar","key":"mahmoodpau","last":"Mahmood","name":"Mahmood, Badar","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten Matthiesen Bach","key":"dammpau","last":"Damm","name":"Damm, Morten Matthiesen Bach","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Thorbjørn Søren Rønn","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Thorbjørn Søren Rønn","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Marie Balslev","key":"backepau","last":"Backe","locid":"f4af604d-c356-4633-94e8-076913cb2903","name":"Backe, Marie Balslev","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mattias Salling","key":"dahllöfpau","last":"Dahllöf","locid":"7bbe347a-9252-4271-8d66-d1b6c065479d","name":"Dahllöf, Mattias Salling","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Steen Seier","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","locid":"8959d81d-fe64-4ef4-86b7-003b7b637e8e","name":"Poulsen, Steen Seier","orcid":"0000-0003-4419-4911","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Niels","key":"bindslevpau","last":"Bindslev","locid":"b34ae3f8-b3e3-4f9f-9b46-3c63a950cb4f","name":"Bindslev, Niels","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mark Berner","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"83318e16-a5f9-4d1e-b22a-5e9ef466ba81","name":"Hansen, Mark Berner","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27927168"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1186/s12885-016-2980-z","issn":["14712407"],"journal":"BMC Cancer","paperid":"938","status":"p","title":"BMC Cancer","title_org":"B M C Cancer","volume":"16"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85002378031"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-8fe0057a-8548-4afe-a829-2ccb4e891d76"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Phosphodiesterases in non-neoplastic appearing colonic mucosa from patients with colorectal neoplasia","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-479428","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Indvinding af skifergas har i de senere år påkaldt sig stigende interesse internationalt og i Danmark. På den baggrund har Miljø- og Fødevareministeriet bedt DTU, GEUS og DCE om at indgå en konsortieaftale om at udarbejde en videnskabelig udredning. Formålet med den videnskabelige udredning er at sætte international viden om indvinding af skifergas i relation til en dansk kontekst. I udredningen redegøres der for de regionale geologiske forhold i skifergasproduktion i Danmark, boring og effekt af boring og frakturering, og der foretages en analyse af de mulige påvirkninger af miljø og vandressourcer samt landskab og trafik. På den baggrund gives der indledningsvist en overordnet beskrivelse af skifergas, forventet anvendt teknologi i forbindelse med skifergasproduktion samt en beskrivelse af mulige miljøpåvirkninger og tilgængelige afværgeforanstaltninger. Den videnskabelige udredning indeholder også en screening af de risici og farer, der kunne være forbundet med skifergasindvinding i Danmark.","author_count":39,"contributors":["Nielsen, Niels Axel","Christensen, Thomas Højlund","Aagaard, Niels-Jørgen","Bach, Hanne","Larsen, Flemming","Britze, Peter","Molzen, Jan Eiersted","Hansen, Steffen Foss","Johnsen, Anders R.","Jensen, Poul Nordemann","Odgaard, Mads H","Bjerg, Poul Løgstrup","Fabricius, Ida Lykke","Jensen, Lotte Bjerregaard","Scheutz, Charlotte","Andersen, Henrik Rasmus","Kjeldsen, Peter","Hjorth, Rune","Baun, Anders","Kozin, Igor","Nikolajew, Maja Møller","Sørensen, Morten Kanne","Nielsen, Thomas Alexander Sick","Schovsbo, Niels","Kidmose, Jakob B.","Gravesen, Peter","Voss, Peter","Jakobsen, Rasmus","Pedersen, Stig Asbjørn Schack","Larsen, Tine B.","Dahl Jensen, Trine","Laier, Troels","Sanderson, Hans","Baattrup-Pedersen, Annette","Winding, Anne","Levin, Gregor","Jessen Rasmussen, Jes","Gustavson, Kim","Frederiksen, Pia"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-376031"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","