{"abstract":"Plant derived diterpenoids are relevant as pharmaceuticals, food additives and fragrances, yet a broader industrial utilization of these bioproducts is limited due to their low natural abundance and high structural complexity. Mimicking the modularity of diterpene biosynthesis in plants, we constructed 51 functional diterpene synthase combinations, 41 of which were “new-to-nature”. Here, we demonstrate stereoselective biosynthesis in Nicotiana benthamiana of 47 diterpene skeletons including natural variants and novel enantiomeric or diastereomeric counterparts. Scalable biotechnological production for four selected industrially relevant targets was realized in engineered strains of Saccharomyces cerevisiae","author_count":12,"contributors":["Andersen-Ranberg, Johan","Kongstad, Kenneth Thermann","Nielsen, Morten Thrane","Bjerg Jensen, Niels","Pateraki, Irini","Bach, Søren Spanner","Hamberger, Britta","Zerbe, Philipp","Stærk, Dan","Bohlmann, Jörg","Møller, Birger Lindberg","Hamberger, Björn Robert"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-503840"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["Canada","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of British Columbia","University of California at Davis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"expanding the landscape of diterpene structural diversity by stereochemically controlled combinatorial biosynthesis","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.201510650","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-503840","identifier":[{"id":"26749264","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84957846958","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC4755150","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-b8f3ee15-6760-451c-a653-4d091b2fafba"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-97CE3917D53BFA64ADFD4BC1D224783B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/162413884/Andersen_Ranberg_et_al_2016_Angewandte_Chemie_International_Edition.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.201510650","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Plant and Environmental Sciences, Section for Plant Biochemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Evolva A/S (Biz)"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"university of california at davis","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of California at Davis","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"ca","key":"university of british columbia","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of British Columbia","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Johan","key":"andersenranbergjohanpau","last":"Andersen-Ranberg","locid":"c4af8fc5-068d-438d-890d-9394ea30b415","name":"Andersen-Ranberg, Johan","orcid":"0000-0002-6597-3431","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Kenneth Thermann","key":"kongstadkenneththermannpau","last":"Kong